Gap G1: floating-point USAGE (COMP-1/COMP-2) is not modelled as IEEE
float; such items are handled in the integer value domain (and a
PICTURE-less item is treated as a group). IBM LR "USAGE clause"
(COMP-1/COMP-2). See cobol-numeric-encoding-design.md.
